<h3 data-start=3D"556" data-end=3D"616">=E2=9D=8C Your ONNX emits dynamic R=
educeMean (illegal for EZKL).</h3>
<hr data-start=3D"618" data-end=3D"621">
<h1 data-start=3D"623" data-end=3D"643">=F0=9F=A7=A8 FINAL DIAGNOSIS</h1>
<p data-start=3D"644" data-end=3D"756">Your ONNX is <em data-start=3D"657" =
data-end=3D"681">structurally supported</em> (Conv, Relu, Gemm),<br data-st=
art=3D"701" data-end=3D"704">
but the <strong data-start=3D"712" data-end=3D"755">ReduceMean operator is =
invalid for EZKL</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"758" data-end=3D"770">This is why:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"772" data-end=3D"902">
<li data-start=3D"772" data-end=3D"796">
<p data-start=3D"774" data-end=3D"796"><code data-start=3D"774" data-end=3D=
"788">gen-settings</code> fails</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"797" data-end=3D"816">
<p data-start=3D"799" data-end=3D"816"><code data-start=3D"799" data-end=3D=
"806">table</code> freezes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"817" data-end=3D"850">
<p data-start=3D"819" data-end=3D"850">no <code data-start=3D"822" data-end=
=3D"837">settings.json</code> is created</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"851" data-end=3D"902">
<p data-start=3D"853" data-end=3D"902">no error is printed (because Tract d=
ies silently)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"904" data-end=3D"936">We must fix the ReduceMean node.</p>
