<hr data-start=3D"1597" data-end=3D"1600">
<h1 data-start=3D"1602" data-end=3D"1657">=F0=9F=94=A5 Why this environment=
 works (technical explanation)</h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"1659" data-end=3D"1684">1. <strong data-start=3D"1666" da=
ta-end=3D"1682">torch=3D=3D2.0.1</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1685" data-end=3D"1895">
<li data-start=3D"1685" data-end=3D"1740">
<p data-start=3D"1687" data-end=3D"1740">Last version with fully stable LEG=
ACY ONNX exporter</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1741" data-end=3D"1772">
<p data-start=3D"1743" data-end=3D"1772">Respects <code data-start=3D"1752"=
 data-end=3D"1770">opset_version=3D17</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1773" data-end=3D"1820">
<p data-start=3D"1775" data-end=3D"1820">Exports ReduceMean with static <co=
de data-start=3D"1806" data-end=3D"1818">axes=3D[2,3]</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1821" data-end=3D"1838">
<p data-start=3D"1823" data-end=3D"1838">No ONNXScript</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1839" data-end=3D"1868">
<p data-start=3D"1841" data-end=3D"1868">No opset 18 autopromotion</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1869" data-end=3D"1895">
<p data-start=3D"1871" data-end=3D"1895">Guaranteed EZKL-friendly</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1897" data-end=3D"1922">2. <strong data-start=3D"1904" da=
ta-end=3D"1920">onnx=3D=3D1.14.0</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1923" data-end=3D"1991">
<li data-start=3D"1923" data-end=3D"1959">
<p data-start=3D"1925" data-end=3D"1959">Version recommended by EZKL devs</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1960" data-end=3D"1991">
<p data-start=3D"1962" data-end=3D"1991">Works perfectly with opset 17</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1993" data-end=3D"2020">3. <strong data-start=3D"2000" da=
ta-end=3D"2018">onnxsim 0.4.33</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2021" data-end=3D"2147">
<li data-start=3D"2021" data-end=3D"2074">
<p data-start=3D"2023" data-end=3D"2074">Works with opset 17 without inject=
ing dynamic ops</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2075" data-end=3D"2147">
<p data-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"2147">Earlier or later versions sometime=
s introduce Expand ops =E2=86=92 breaks EZKL</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2149" data-end=3D"2173">4. <strong data-start=3D"2156" da=
ta-end=3D"2171">EZKL 0.8.1+</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2278">
<li data-start=3D"2174" data-end=3D"2184">
<p data-start=3D"2176" data-end=3D"2184">Stable</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2185" data-end=3D"2219">
<p data-start=3D"2187" data-end=3D"2219">Compatible with Tract opset 17</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2220" data-end=3D"2278">
<p data-start=3D"2222" data-end=3D"2278">Zero freezing issues when the ONNX=
 is correctly exported</p>
</li>
</ul>
