<hr data-start=3D"1897" data-end=3D"1900">
<h1 data-start=3D"1902" data-end=3D"1938">=F0=9F=94=A5 Why NOT use <code da=
ta-start=3D"1919" data-end=3D"1937">uv sync --frozen</code>?</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1940" data-end=3D"1948">Because:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1950" data-end=3D"2164">
<li data-start=3D"1950" data-end=3D"1979">
<p data-start=3D"1952" data-end=3D"1979">It <strong data-start=3D"1955" dat=
a-end=3D"1964">locks</strong> dependencies</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1980" data-end=3D"2008">
<p data-start=3D"1982" data-end=3D"2008">It <strong data-start=3D"1985" dat=
a-end=3D"2006">keeps Python 3.12</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2009" data-end=3D"2044">
<p data-start=3D"2011" data-end=3D"2044">It <strong data-start=3D"2014" dat=
a-end=3D"2042">avoids changing packages</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2045" data-end=3D"2095">
<p data-start=3D"2047" data-end=3D"2095">It <strong data-start=3D"2050" dat=
a-end=3D"2093">guarantees PyTorch 2.0.1 cannot install</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2096" data-end=3D"2125">
<p data-start=3D"2098" data-end=3D"2125">It <strong data-start=3D"2101" dat=
a-end=3D"2123">prevents opset fix</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2126" data-end=3D"2164">
<p data-start=3D"2128" data-end=3D"2164">It <strong data-start=3D"2131" dat=
a-end=3D"2164">keeps your environment broken</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2166" data-end=3D"2235">You must <strong data-start=3D"217=
5" data-end=3D"2209">start a clean 3.10 environment</strong>, not sync the =
broken one.</p>
