</li>
<li data-start=3D"2260" data-end=3D"2290">
<p data-start=3D"2262" data-end=3D"2290">remove unnecessary FC layers</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2291" data-end=3D"2349">
<p data-start=3D"2293" data-end=3D"2349">use smaller input resolution (64=
=E2=86=9232, but accuracy drops)</p>
</li>
