only to <strong data-start=3D"1715" data-end=3D"1727">generate</strong> <co=
de data-start=3D"1728" data-end=3D"1736">pk.key</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1739" data-end=3D"1790">Miner proving memory usage is much=
 lower (~2=E2=80=936 GB).</p>
