</li>
<li data-start=3D"1225" data-end=3D"1247">
<p data-start=3D"1227" data-end=3D"1247">range check tables</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1248" data-end=3D"1272">
<p data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1272">proving key creation</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1274" data-end=3D"1302">This all happens in CPU RAM.</p>
