<h1 data-start=3D"1133" data-end=3D"1162">=E2=9D=97 BUT <strong data-start=
=3D"1141" data-end=3D"1162">Important Warning</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"1163" data-end=3D"1238">SN2 miner + ONNX export + torch tr=
aining <strong data-start=3D"1204" data-end=3D"1237">often requires exact v=
ersions</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1240" data-end=3D"1388">
<li data-start=3D"1240" data-end=3D"1280">
<p data-start=3D"1242" data-end=3D"1280">torch must match your Python versi=
on</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1281" data-end=3D"1314">
<p data-start=3D"1283" data-end=3D"1314">onnx must match torch version</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1315" data-end=3D"1339">
<p data-start=3D"1317" data-end=3D"1339">ezkl must be v23.0.3</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1340" data-end=3D"1356">
<p data-start=3D"1342" data-end=3D"1356">no numpy 2.x</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1357" data-end=3D"1388">
<p data-start=3D"1359" data-end=3D"1388">no uv environment pollution</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1390" data-end=3D"1455">If you install globally on a clean=
 GCP or AWS machine, it=E2=80=99s fine.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1544">If you install globally on a messy=
 machine, <strong data-start=3D"1501" data-end=3D"1544">version conflicts m=
ay break your miner.</strong></p>
