<h3 data-start=3D"1899" data-end=3D"1943">=F0=9F=91=89 Keep a dedicated ven=
v for the miner</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1944" data-end=3D"1948">Why?</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1950" data-end=3D"2163">
<li data-start=3D"1950" data-end=3D"1983">
<p data-start=3D"1952" data-end=3D"1983">prevents dependency conflicts</p>
