<li data-start=3D"2874" data-end=3D"2918">
<p data-start=3D"2876" data-end=3D"2918"><strong data-start=3D"2876" data-e=
nd=3D"2883">F32</strong> =3D float32 =E2=86=92 =E2=9C=85 your <code data-st=
art=3D"2903" data-end=3D"2910">input</code> is F32.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2919" data-end=3D"3020">
<p data-start=3D"2921" data-end=3D"3020">You=E2=80=99re <strong data-start=
=3D"2928" data-end=3D"2970">missing the required <code data-start=3D"2951" =
data-end=3D"2958">nonce</code> F32 input</strong>, so right now you <strong=
 data-start=3D"2989" data-end=3D"2998">don=E2=80=99t</strong> meet the subn=
et spec.</p>
</li>
