<p data-start=3D"2102" data-end=3D"2150">If <strong data-start=3D"2105" dat=
a-end=3D"2112">any</strong> mismatch =E2=86=92 proof invalid =E2=86=92 scor=
e =3D 0.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2152" data-end=3D"2166">This includes:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2168" data-end=3D"2389">
<li data-start=3D"2168" data-end=3D"2184">
<p data-start=3D"2170" data-end=3D"2184">wrong shapes</p>
