<p data-start=3D"8079" data-end=3D"8154">Plug these paths into your miner=
=E2=80=99s config (<code data-start=3D"8122" data-end=3D"8141">miner_config=
.yaml</code> or similar).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8155" data-end=3D"8254">
<p data-start=3D"8158" data-end=3D"8254">Make sure the validator/mode you u=
se is pointing to the same competition config (Competition 1).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8255" data-end=3D"8295">
<p data-start=3D"8258" data-end=3D"8295">Start the miner with pm2 or direct=
ly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8296" data-end=3D"8434">
<p data-start=3D"8299" data-end=3D"8321">Check logs to confirm:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8325" data-end=3D"8434">
<li data-start=3D"8325" data-end=3D"8381">
<p data-start=3D"8327" data-end=3D"8381">it loads <code data-start=3D"8336"=
 data-end=3D"8381">model.onnx / circuit.ezkl / pk.key / vk.key</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8385" data-end=3D"8434">
<p data-start=3D"8387" data-end=3D"8434">it=E2=80=99s answering validator r=
equests successfully.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"8436" data-end=3D"8461">If you want, next we can:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8463" data-end=3D"8631">
<li data-start=3D"8463" data-end=3D"8506">
<p data-start=3D"8465" data-end=3D"8506">Take your <strong data-start=3D"84=
75" data-end=3D"8503">actual miner config file</strong>,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8507" data-end=3D"8551">
<p data-start=3D"8509" data-end=3D"8551">Fill in the exact paths to this ci=
rcuit,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8552" data-end=3D"8631">
<p data-start=3D"8554" data-end=3D"8631">And write the <strong data-start=
=3D"8568" data-end=3D"8589">pm2 start command</strong> for you so it all ho=
oks together cleanly.</p>
</li>
</ul>
