<p data-start=3D"830" data-end=3D"874">There is <strong data-start=3D"839" =
data-end=3D"870">NO mention of nonce in ONNX</strong> in:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"876" data-end=3D"970">
<li data-start=3D"876" data-end=3D"903">
<p data-start=3D"878" data-end=3D"903">competition_config.json</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"904" data-end=3D"924">
<p data-start=3D"906" data-end=3D"924">circuit_settings</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"925" data-end=3D"937">
<p data-start=3D"927" data-end=3D"937">age.onnx</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"938" data-end=3D"970">
<p data-start=3D"940" data-end=3D"970">the validator inference path</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"972" data-end=3D"1030">The SN2 validator <strong data-star=
t=3D"990" data-end=3D"1029">never tries to feed nonce into ONNX</strong>.</=
