<hr data-start=3D"4272" data-end=3D"4275">
<h1 data-start=3D"4277" data-end=3D"4330">=F0=9F=94=A5 STRATEGY 7 =E2=80=94=
 GPU OFFLOAD (optional but powerful)</h1>
<p data-start=3D"4332" data-end=3D"4356">EZKL CPU prover is slow.</p>
<p data-start=3D"4358" data-end=3D"4385">If you enable CUDA backend:</p>
