</li>
<li data-start=3D"4450" data-end=3D"4475">
<p data-start=3D"4452" data-end=3D"4475">SOTA becomes achievable</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4477" data-end=3D"4540">GPU variance is <em data-start=3D"=
4493" data-end=3D"4500">lower</em> than CPU variance =E2=80=94 <strong data=
-start=3D"4521" data-end=3D"4539">huge advantage</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"4542" data-end=3D"4545">
