<h1 data-start=3D"1117" data-end=3D"1174">=F0=9F=A7=A0 <strong data-start=
=3D"1122" data-end=3D"1174">2. So why do circuits exist? Why build your own=
?</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"1176" data-end=3D"1212">Because SN2 allows miners to suppl=
y:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1214" data-end=3D"1289">
<li data-start=3D"1214" data-end=3D"1235">
<p data-start=3D"1216" data-end=3D"1235">their own circuit</p>
</li>
